[
    {
        "id": "garden_power_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "═══════════════ GARDEN POWER MONITORING ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Garden Power Monitoring\n\nMonitors and controls power for the house garden using Sonoff Power device.\n\n### Device\n- Type: Sonoff Power (Tasmota)\n- Device ID: sonoffPower320D_afara\n\n### MQTT Topics\n- Sensor: tele/sonoffPower320D_afara/SENSOR\n- Status: stat/sonoffPower320D_afara/POWER\n- Command: cmnd/sonoffPower320D_afara/Power\n\n### Monitoring\n- Voltage (V)\n- Current (A)\n- Power (W)\n- Total Consumption (kWh)\n- Today Consumption (kWh)\n- Yesterday Consumption (kWh)\n\n### Control\n- ON/OFF switch\n\n### Dependencies\n- Requires: ui_group_garden_power (from base config)\n- Requires: mqtt_broker_local",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 100,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "garden_power_sensor_in",
        "type": "mqtt in",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "Garden Power Sensor",
        "topic": "tele/sonoffPower320D_afara/SENSOR",
        "qos": "2",
        "datatype": "json",
        "broker": "mqtt_broker_local",
        "nl": false,
        "rap": true,
        "rh": 0,
        "inputs": 0,
        "x": 220,
        "y": 200,
        "wires": [
            [
                "garden_power_store_metrics",
                "garden_power_extract_voltage",
                "garden_power_extract_current",
                "garden_power_extract_power",
                "garden_power_extract_total",
                "garden_power_extract_today",
                "garden_power_extract_yesterday"
            ]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "garden_power_store_metrics",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "Store Garden Power Metrics",
        "func": "// Store all power metrics in flow context\nlet gardenState = flow.get('garden_power_state') || {};\n\nif (msg.payload && msg.payload.ENERGY) {\n    gardenState.voltage = msg.payload.ENERGY.Voltage;\n    gardenState.current = msg.payload.ENERGY.Current;\n    gardenState.power = msg.payload.ENERGY.Power;\n    gardenState.total = msg.payload.ENERGY.Total;\n    gardenState.today = msg.payload.ENERGY.Today;\n    gardenState.yesterday = msg.payload.ENERGY.Yesterday;\n    gardenState.lastUpdate = new Date().toISOString();\n    \n    flow.set('garden_power_state', gardenState);\n}\n\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 0,
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 550,
        "y": 160,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "garden_power_extract_voltage",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "tab_dashboard",
        "name": "Extract Voltage",
        "func": "if (msg.payload && msg.payload.ENERGY) {\n    msg.payload = msg.payload.ENERGY.Voltage + ' V';\n    return msg;\n}\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 470,
        "y": 200,
        "wires": [
            ["garden_power_voltage_display"]
